<title>CHILE: Chilean inflation 0.4 pct November - sources.</title>
<headline>Chilean inflation 0.4 pct November - sources.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official figures to be released later Wednesday will show Chilean consumer prices rose 0.4 percent in November, market sources said.</p>
<p>Prices rose 0.7 percent in October and 0.1 percent in November 1995.</p>
<p>-- Santiago Newsroom 56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
